<code>assert \result.length == this.size();</code>

It seems there was a mistake in the comment interpretation. The comment states that "The returned array length is one greater than the collection size," but the actual implementation returns an array with a length equal to the collection size. Therefore, the correct assert statement should reflect that the length of the returned array is equal to the size of the collection.

Thus, the correct assert statement is:
<code>assert \result.length == this.size();</code>
